     4396                                       ub.ot-line.obj-type  = gds-obj.obj-type
     4397                                       no-lock no-error .
     4398           if avail gds-obj then do:
     4399             if v-var = "no-today" then do:
     4400               run ost-line in this-procedure
     4401               (input   gds-obj.obj-code  ,
     4402               input   gds-obj.obj-type  ,
     4403               input   gds-obj.artic     ,
     4404               input   gds-obj.prod-code ,
     4405               input   gds-obj.prod-type ,
