     5295       IF ( line-counter( OutStream )  modulo page-size( OutStream ) = 0 ) AND
     5296           ( line-counter( OutStream ) >= page-size( OutStream ) )          then DO:
     5297           display STREAM OutStream    with frame top-frame .
     5298       End.
     5299     End.
     5300     if c-f-crsa-sum-o <>  ?  then do :
