     7301           dIsplay stream OutStream with FRAME Zapas no-error .
     7302           DOWN stream OutStream with FRAME Zapas.
     7303         run u-line.
     7304            if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     7305            "ИТОГО"                       CHR(9)
     7306            "ПО ВСЕМ ОБЬЕКТАМ"            CHR(9)
     7307            excel-qnty(accum TOTAL f-qnty           )   CHR(9)
     7308            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-cost-sum       )   CHR(9)
     7309            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-sale-sum       )   CHR(9)
     7310            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-sale-other     )   CHR(9)
     7311            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-crsa-sum       )   CHR(9)
     7312            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-qnty-all       )   CHR(9)
     7313            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-cost-sum-all   )   CHR(9)
     7314            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-crsa-sum-all   )   CHR(9)
     7315            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-qnty-o         )   CHR(9)
     7316            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-cost-sum-o     )   CHR(9)
     7317            excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-crsa-sum-o     )   chr(10) .
     7318       End.
     7319   END PROCEDURE.
